%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: fc730475ed18dc949b8c9fd8435ab43e, type: 3}
  m_Name: Floor5
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  introLines: []
  casualLines:
  - ..
  - ..
  - Hm~
  - ~
  - Lala... lala
  - Hm Hm~
  - '... '
  - Oh there you are.
  - I have been waiting for you to come back.
  - What takes you so long?
  - Let me help you get out.
  - 'Keeps walking and walking and walking '
  - And never go back
  - Do what you always have done.
  - You know it by heart. And they know it too.
  - So they are waiting at the end.
  - You reached another hallway. It was identical to the last. And the one before
    that.
  - Should you go back? But the elevator is not there anymore!
  - You kept walking and walking but the hallway kept you.
  - You paused. And then moved. The decision was yours, wasn't it?
  - You did not know what was beneath the floor, or behind the ceiling, or inside
    the walls.
  - Every step sounds the same. Perfect. Predictable. Controlled
  - "Don\u2019t worry. I\u2019ll be with you the whole way. I always am."
  - Something shifted behind the walls.
  - "You were certain this hallway ended at a door. It doesn\u2019t anymore."
  - "The vents are whispering again. Don\u2019t listen too long."
  - But have you ever wondered why you are trapped here?
  - We never know... we never know.....
  - I know a truth. A truth that you buried
  - 'But... '
  - I don't think it is the right time yet.
  - This truth can either help you escape or trap you here forever.
  eventPresets:
  - state: 2
    lines:
    - You saw it before, what do you think it means?
    - I didn't write it, I told you.
    triggerOnce: 1
    triggered: 0
  - state: 1
    lines:
    - In a few seconds, you will pick up the flashlight again
    triggerOnce: 1
    triggered: 0
  - state: 3
    lines:
    - 'The sound... its telling you something. '
    - Shhh.... something is approaching
    triggerOnce: 1
    triggered: 0
  - state: 4
    lines:
    - You heard it again, right?
    - IT SAID TO GET OUT OF HERE
    triggerOnce: 1
    triggered: 0
  - state: 5
    lines:
    - Oh him again, walking in his dreams
    - He has been here longer than you, trying to find the exit
    - Don't breath near him, it will wake him up
    triggerOnce: 1
    triggered: 0
  - state: 6
    lines:
    - You found the elevator again.
    - Maybe this time, you should stay inside and wait instead
    - Stay where the light is
    triggerOnce: 1
    triggered: 0
  - state: 7
    lines:
    - Wait... where are you going?
    - We might restart again.
    - No.... Don't!
    triggerOnce: 1
    triggered: 0
  - state: 8
    lines:
    - What?! You figured it out?
    - But did you know the truth?
    - 'I warn you: there is no escape.'
    - Because there is no reality
    triggerOnce: 1
    triggered: 0
